{"clubs":{"Stacey":{"title":"The fortress","kit":"Light blue & black","bio":"Stacey\u2019s emblem stands guard over a floodlit fortress. A compact back line sets the tone. Win the duel, hold the line, then find the pass that takes the team forward.","image":"/assets/club-Stacey.webp","players":["AK","Daniel (C)","Elliot","Harry B","Jeremiah","KP","Meyene","Rasheed","Saad","Warryn"]},"CityMen":{"title":"City rhythm","kit":"Crimson & white","bio":"A red skyline, a ball on concrete and a passing lane that opens for an instant. CityMen\u2019s identity belongs to street football, where a quick touch can change the whole game.","image":"/assets/club-CityMen.webp","players":["Abz","Ben","Blessing","Derrick","Dickson","Ebenezer (C)","Georginho","Georginho (Pen)","Gerginho","Henry","James","John E","Mo","Omer","Prince"]},"Infinity":{"title":"The endless run","kit":"Deep blue & cyan","bio":"Two loops trace the path of a move that keeps going. An Infinity runner lays the ball off, turns and arrives again on the other side of the defender.","image":"/assets/club-Infinity.webp","players":["Abood (C)","Brandon","Ibrahim","Isreal","Lawrence","Mark","Onnie","Pete","Tommy","Tony"]},"Angels":{"title":"Under one wing","kit":"White & silver","bio":"Silver wings frame the ball on the Angels crest. Their story is about cover and trust. When one player steps out to challenge, a teammate is already protecting the space behind.","image":"/assets/club-Angels.webp","players":["Abbas","Abiola","Adrian","Farouk S.","Fola","Malvin","Nheeyo","Reece","Rob. H","Teddy (C)","Yahya"]},"Foxes":{"title":"The orange ambush","kit":"Orange & black","bio":"The fox waits for one loose touch. Then the orange shirts break together. Foxes FC return as Season 25 champions after finishing on 13 points.","image":"/assets/club-Foxes.webp","players":["Ace","Caleeb","Connor","Drenzy","Keith","Khash","Marcus","Samuel","Seyi","Steve (C)","Toby","Zod"]},"Darkfang":{"title":"The night watch","kit":"Black & gold","bio":"A tiger plants a boot on the ball. Darkfang\u2019s black shirt and gold crest give the club its identity. Discipline defines its story: hold shape, measure the distance, choose the moment to strike.","image":"/assets/club-Darkfang.webp","players":["Brandon","Glo (C)","Habib","Naji","Ola","Panashe","Saied","Tanzeem","Tawheed","Teejay","Uwa"]},"Typhoon":{"title":"Into the storm","kit":"Green","bio":"The first runner forces the pass. The second closes the outlet. Typhoon\u2019s wave crest captures the feeling of a press arriving from every direction.","image":"/assets/club-Typhoon.webp","players":["Ahmed","Alfie","Dylan","Enock","Eric","Freddie","Jamie","Marko (C)","Pablo","Timo","Timothy"]}},"matches":[{"home":"Typhoon FC","away":"CityMen FC","round":"Round 1","venue":"Pitch 1","kickoff":"13:00","status":"scheduled","id":"s26-1","events":[],"lineups":{},"stream":""},{"home":"Infinity FC","away":"Stacey FC","round":"Round 1","venue":"Pitch 2","kickoff":"13:00","status":"scheduled","id":"s26-2","events":[],"lineups":{},"stream":""},{"home":"Foxes FC","away":"Darkfang FC","round":"Round 1","venue":"Pitch 1","kickoff":"13:15","status":"scheduled","id":"s26-3","events":[],"lineups":{},"stream":""},{"home":"Stacey FC","away":"Angels FC","round":"Round 2","venue":"Pitch 2","kickoff":"13:15","status":"scheduled","id":"s26-4","events":[],"lineups":{},"stream":""},{"home":"Darkfang FC","away":"Typhoon FC","round":"Round 2","venue":"Pitch 1","kickoff":"13:30","status":"scheduled","id":"s26-5","events":[],"lineups":{},"stream":""},{"home":"Foxes FC","away":"Infinity FC","round":"Round 2","venue":"Pitch 2","kickoff":"13:30","status":"scheduled","id":"s26-6","events":[],"lineups":{},"stream":""},{"home":"CityMen FC","away":"Darkfang FC","round":"Round 3","venue":"Pitch 1","kickoff":"13:45","status":"scheduled","id":"s26-7","events":[],"lineups":{},"stream":""},{"home":"Angels FC","away":"Foxes FC","round":"Round 3","venue":"Pitch 2","kickoff":"13:45","status":"scheduled","id":"s26-8